{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Visual LabX 是一款專為喜愛復古風格照片的用戶設計的 AI 照片編輯應用程式，提供多種復古濾鏡、美學效果及免費修飾工具。目前推出終生版限時免費活動，讓用戶免費解鎖全部高級功能。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能介紹</h2>\n<p>應用程式內建豐富的復古濾鏡，能夠模擬膠卷相機的色調與顆粒感，同時具備 AI 驅動的修飾工具，可智慧檢測臉部與身體進行自然美化。此外，FX 工具允許在同一張照片上疊加多重效果，創造出獨特的復古氛圍。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1290x2796bb-31-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1290x2796bb-32-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1290x2796bb-33-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1290x2796bb-34-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1290x2796bb-35-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1290x2796bb-36-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Visual LabX 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Visual LabX: AI Retro 照片 Photo</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-21T23:17:41.845810+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}